<view class="page-shell editor-page"><view class="page-heading"><text class="eyebrow">就诊人信息</text><text class="page-title">实名信息</text><text class="page-subtitle">身份证号用于处方审核和用药相关信息，请确认填写准确。</text></view><view class="surface form-card"><text class="field-label">姓名</text><input class="form-input" data-field="name" value="{{name}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="请输入真实姓名" /><text class="field-label">身份证号</text><input class="form-input" data-field="idNo" value="{{idNo}}" bindinput="input" password="{{false}}" placeholder="请输入身份证号" /><text class="field-label">手机号</text><input class="form-input" data-field="phone" value="{{phone}}" bindinput="input" type="number" placeholder="请输入手机号" /><text class="field-label">与本人关系</text><picker range="{{relations}}" value="0" bindchange="relationChange"><view class="picker-row"><text>{{relation}}</text><text>⌄</text></view></picker><text class="field-label">过敏史</text><textarea class="form-textarea" data-field="allergies" value="{{allergies}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="如无请填写暂无" /><text class="field-label">既往病史</text><textarea class="form-textarea" data-field="history" value="{{history}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="选填，用于后续健康服务" /><label class="consent-line"><checkbox value="health" checked="{{healthConsent}}" bindchange="consentChange" color="#0f766e" /><text>我同意将健康信息用于本次购药和后续健康管理服务。</text></label></view><view class="primary-button save-button" bindtap="save">保存就诊人</view></view>

